    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.poster.avif?t=1720976369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.webm?t=1720976369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.mp4?t=1720976369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN THE DISCORD:</h2> <br><br>From the creator of OLDTV, comes a unique sequel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Download the internet.<br></li><li> Unlock hidden characters<br></li><li> Gain weird skills &amp; abilities <br></li><li> Don't break up with your girlfriend<br></li><li> Better music than oldtv<br></li><li> Discover Secrets</li></ul><br><strong>BACKOFSPACE</strong> is the spiritual sequel to OLDTV.<br><br>OLDTV introduced a new game idea, and now we're building a game that lights that idea on fire.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NAUSEA, VERTIGO, COLORBLINDNESS:</h2>This game is not recommended for people who suffer from neurological issues such as sensitivity to developing nausea or if you have an underlying issue such as vertigo or colorblindess.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE OF AI:</h2>The game product uses AI generated art in it's background per region. You can read more about the terms of usage here:<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.poster.avif?t=1720976369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.webm?t=1720976369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.mp4?t=1720976369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN THE DISCORD:</h2> <br><br>From the creator of OLDTV, comes a unique sequel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Download the internet.<br></li><li> Unlock hidden characters<br></li><li> Gain weird skills &amp; abilities <br></li><li> Don't break up with your girlfriend<br></li><li> Better music than oldtv<br></li><li> Discover Secrets</li></ul><br><strong>BACKOFSPACE</strong> is the spiritual sequel to OLDTV.<br><br>OLDTV introduced a new game idea, and now we're building a game that lights that idea on fire.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NAUSEA, VERTIGO, COLORBLINDNESS:</h2>This game is not recommended for people who suffer from neurological issues such as sensitivity to developing nausea or if you have an underlying issue such as vertigo or colorblindess.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE OF AI:</h2>The game product uses AI generated art in it's background per region. You can read more about the terms of usage here:<br><br>",
